        p class="sensor-card__state" "Lost contact"
        button aria-label="Connect Xparkle RVS01 sensor" class="link-button sensor-card__connect" hidden="" type="button" "Connect"
        div class="box-password" hidden=""
          p class="menu__text menu__text--warning" "The Xparkle RVS01 box did not accept its password. Type the box’s four-digit code below and tap Try again. The factory code is 0000. If you don’t know the code, change it in the Xparkle app."
