          p class="menu__text" "This browser cannot yet reconnect to the box on its own, so after a restart you pick it in the list again. In Chrome you can turn this on yourself."
          p class="menu__text" "Open chrome://flags, search for “web bluetooth”, set “Use the new permissions backend for Web Bluetooth” to Enabled and tap Relaunch. Then connect the box once."
          button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Copy chrome://flags""
`;

exports[`the calibration cards (#735) > draw the same DOM (classic cards) 1`] = `
"div
  div class="" hidden=""
    h3 class="menu__heading"
    p class="menu__text" "Level the vehicle once with a spirit level, then zero."
    button class="menu__action" type="button" "Zero now"
    p class="menu__text menu__text--status"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" hidden="" type="button" "Undo"
    p class="menu__text" "The phone’s own calibration is hidden while the sensor box measures. To calibrate the phone, open the box and tap \\"Disconnect\\" first."
    button class="link-button" type="button" "Show the box"
  div
    h3 class="menu__heading" "Calibrate the phone"
    p class="menu__text" "Put the phone on a surface you know is level, then tap Calibrate now. The current tilt becomes the zero point."
    p class="menu__text menu__text--status" "Not calibrated — using the raw sensor."
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" hidden="" type="button" "Undo"
    button class="menu__action" type="button" "Calibrate now"
    p class="menu__text" "No level surface around? Use flip calibration: put the phone down anywhere reasonably flat, capture, rotate the phone half a turn (180°) on the same spot, capture again — the surface tilt cancels itself out."
    button class="menu__action" type="button" "Calibrate by flipping"
    p class="menu__text menu__text--status"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" hidden="" type="button" "Undo"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Check"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" hidden="" type="button" "Clear calibration"
  div
    h3 class="menu__heading" "Zero the vehicle"
    p class="menu__text" "Calibration is about the phone, not the spot where it lies. If the table tilts a little, the app shows that tilt. Level the vehicle once with a spirit level, put the phone in its usual place and zero."
    p class="menu__text menu__text--status" "Vehicle zero: front/back −0.2°, side/side +0.4°."
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" hidden="" type="button" "Undo"
    button class="menu__action" type="button" "Zero now"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Check"
    button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Forget the zero"
    div class="zero-trim"
      p class="menu__text zero-trim__title" "Fine-tune the zero"
      p class="menu__text" "Still not quite level? Each tap moves the zero by 0.1°, so the app wants that side higher."
      div class="zero-trim__buttons"
        button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Left up"
        button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Right up"
        button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Front up"
        button class="menu__action menu__action--secondary" type="button" "Back up"
      p aria-live="polite" class="menu__text menu__text--status" "Not fine-tuned"
      button class="link-button" disabled="" type="button" "Reset fine-tuning"

